   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reflexive verbs",
     "texto": [
      "In Polish, the reflexive pronoun **się** is usually a separate word and can come after the verb: **myję się**, **ubieram się**.",
      "The verb agrees with the person; **się** does not change. English shows the same idea with words like «myself» or «yourself»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
